  "body": "Unpublished validation fixture for the normal-startup repair on PR #1028. Not approved for public distribution.\n\nDeveloper ID signed, Apple notarization accepted and stapled. The checksum manifest is Sigstore-authenticated as anthony@bnfy.me through the GitHub issuer; verify with the repository release-verification instructions.\n\nFixes the reported default startup choice: ordinary launch restores the saved session while explicit user and managed startup preferences take precedence. Fresh and private profiles are handled separately. Final 89 signed checks passed, including two ordinary restarts without a restore flag.\n\nKnown unresolved finding: an earlier malformed-session recovery schedule stalled on a subsequent launch; the later full schedule and old/new online/offline controls passed. Its cause remains unqualified. L6 and L8 remain open pending disposition and the owner's normal MacBook restart check. Do not treat the final passing run as proof that the intermittent wait is repaired.\n\nGoogle baseline remains separate. Latency and the Electron diagnostic build remain pending. This draft neither merges #1028 nor authorizes release.\n"
